```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as run_nexus.py
    participant Nexus as Nexus Class
    participant Runtime as runtime.loop
    participant Stepper as runtime.stepper
    participant Core as CoreEngine
    participant FS as Filesystem
    
    User->>CLI: python vdm_rt/run_nexus.py --neurons 1000 --hz 10 --duration 60
    CLI->>CLI: Parse args via make_parser()
    CLI->>CLI: Resolve --load-engram (if provided)
    CLI->>CLI: Set run_dir = runs/{timestamp} or engram parent
    CLI->>Nexus: Nexus(run_dir, N, k, hz, domain, seed, ...)
    
    Nexus->>Nexus: Create run_dir/
    Nexus->>Nexus: Initialize logger → events.jsonl
    Nexus->>Nexus: Initialize UTE (user text entry)
    Nexus->>Nexus: Initialize UTD (telemetry display)
    Nexus->>Nexus: Initialize emitters (Macro, Thought)
    Nexus->>Nexus: Load lexicon, phrase templates
    Nexus->>Nexus: Initialize SparseConnectome(N, k, seed)
    Nexus->>Core: Create CoreEngine(connectome, maps, scouts)
    
    alt Load Engram
        Nexus->>FS: load_engram(path)
        FS-->>Nexus: State loaded (w, b, step)
        Nexus->>Nexus: Set start_step from checkpoint
    end
    
    Nexus-->>CLI: Nexus instance ready
    CLI->>Nexus: nexus.run(duration_s=60)
    Nexus->>Runtime: run_loop(state, config, ...)
    
    Runtime->>Runtime: Calculate total_ticks = duration_s * hz
    
    loop tick = start_step to total_ticks
        Runtime->>Runtime: Apply phase profile (if any)
        Runtime->>Runtime: Poll UTE for user messages
        
        alt User sent text
            Runtime->>Runtime: symbols_to_indices(text)
            Runtime->>Core: Stimulate connectome
        end
        
        Runtime->>Stepper: compute_step_and_metrics(engine, ...)
        Stepper->>Core: engine.step()
        Core->>Core: Execute void walkers (scouts)
        Core->>Core: Update cortical maps
        Core->>Core: Apply neuroplasticity (GDSP)
        Core->>Core: Emit proprioception events
        Core-->>Stepper: Observation dict
        Stepper->>Stepper: Compute metrics (ZEMA, graph stats)
        Stepper->>Stepper: Apply B1 detector
        Stepper-->>Runtime: Observation + metrics
        
        Runtime->>Runtime: Aggregate telemetry (tick_fold)
        Runtime->>Runtime: Emit macros (if speak gate passes)
        Runtime->>Runtime: Emit thoughts (if enabled)
        Runtime->>FS: Log events.jsonl
        
        alt tick % checkpoint_every == 0
            Runtime->>FS: save_tick_checkpoint(state, format=h5)
            Runtime->>Runtime: Prune old checkpoints (keep N)
        end
        
        alt tick % viz_every == 0
            Runtime->>FS: Save visualization (graph PNG)
        end
        
        Runtime->>FS: Write status.json (HTTP endpoint)
    end
    
    Runtime-->>Nexus: Loop complete
    Nexus->>FS: Final checkpoint
    Nexus->>FS: Close logs
    Nexus-->>CLI: Run finished
    CLI-->>User: Exit
```
